{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ecc7d315b733f6f6bf030058992cafa02ebd358095426554c6bdfac3ca8ac3ad", "ja": "翼、お疲れさま！　今日のPV撮影、絶好調だったな。\n思った以上に早く終わって、驚いたよ。", "zh": "翼，你辛苦了！今天的PV拍摄，你状态非常好呢。\n拍摄比预期的还要早结束，吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "98f8c4154c9a67ebb53f018e274ca16079c8b02f4d870d210e8401b0b1079c61", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦你了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43f20e4cb49b708b49e7513dfa7fe45385131db68d3992e6ff63c62560a9b42b", "ja": "風邪でいっぱい休んじゃいましたけど、\nその分、今日はすっごくがんばったんですよ！", "zh": "之前我感冒休息了很久，\n为了弥补回来，我今天超努力的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8a848872da27dfc0fa33847a07f3455ccb20ec6a1d6b8eae99f10a1b66cdd5bb", "ja": "うん、元気になったみたいで俺も一安心だ。\nそれより、体調は大丈夫か？", "zh": "嗯，看你似乎恢复精神了，我也松了一口气。\n倒是你的身体状况还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "edabc5a25c85883434eecd9d02a804c058a751348d89828bde9ce67225b2e272", "ja": "もしかして、俺が翼に無理をさせてしまったんじゃ\nないかと思って……。", "zh": "我在想会不会是我\n让你太勉强自己了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "69cdb285a7ba701d79284b4564a735fd717c7e0101b8b82829bacc39c5692b17", "ja": "わたし、無理なんてしたコトないですよ？\nわたしはわたしのペースで、楽しんでやってるもんね♪", "zh": "我从来没有勉强自己过喔！\n因为我会照着自己的步调，开心做什么就做什么♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f27c707e54faff65707c827904ff576923c303f45bf6732eee9ab91dccfe6d93", "ja": "……まぁ、そうか。\nレッスンもたまにサボったりしてるみたいだし……。", "zh": "……唉，也是啦。\n毕竟我看你有时候好像会翘掉练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0acc6a743c38b030a298e730ae7d52f89284962d1217adad98787c5e133ab526", "ja": "そんなコトないですよー。\n昨日は、ちゃんと出ました！", "zh": "才没有这种事咧～\n至少昨天我有乖乖出席！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c5ce6779edf545e18fe4a1c796c83a9493ff19a60116a19486d09a62f27ec14c", "ja": "昨日はって……そこは胸を張って言う事じゃないだろ。\nまったく、まだまだ翼からは目が離せないな。", "zh": "还敢说至少昨天有……这不是什么该得意的事吧。\n真是的，看来我还是要好好盯着翼才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7390ffe7642f5d56dc4186f215c91e29f68a1f9ec5177f71a43f7d5a334ace2c", "ja": "もー、{$P$}さん？　わたしが\n真面目に来たら、目を離しちゃうつもりなんですか？", "zh": "哎～{$P$}先生？\n要是我认真出席，你就不打算盯着我了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8899ca6c6b215dad3980becf7acdaa09f585422897242f21c7726dc365ca9f8d", "ja": "むぅ～。\nだったらわたし、これからもレッスンに出ないかも。", "zh": "唔～\n既然这样，我以后可能还是不会参加训练吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "106ebb38318ec9a3a196ef6014af3b63b38e68abf52335b27a0969f687564d84", "ja": "こ、こらこら。それは困る！\nレッスンには、ちゃんと出てくれないと……。", "zh": "喂、喂喂，这可不行啊！\n你一定要按时参加训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7a4f332cb64459016f207cebd6c4496b02c1b38b34ca8c9bdad6f05ac249180", "ja": "じゃあ、これからも……ずーっと、\nわたしのそばにいてくれるってコトですよね？", "zh": "那意思是你今后……\n也愿意一～直待在我的身边啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d8393606a3ade0a70397968d2965fa5208fe494dc8df026004c38e388d26fe37", "ja": "休んでたときも、一番にお見舞いに来てくれたし。\n{$P$}さんってば、優しい♪", "zh": "就连我请假的时候，你也是第一个来探病的。\n{$P$}先生真的好温柔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "60aff1bda727311142f6dad043aa7d08e6aafb34569605353405caa3898dff28", "ja": "それは、翼のプロデューサーだからな……\n心配するのは当たり前だよ。", "zh": "那是因为我是翼的制作人啊……\n会担心是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b0e70eedaa76d449ae3955eb5131ec3147934bce540a3c89e970a2f2ff74a03f", "ja": "えへへ……あ、思い出した！　お見舞いに\n来てくれた時の約束、まだしてもらってないですよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿……啊，我想起来了！\n你来探病时跟我做的约定，还没实践对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1016_p", "source_sha256": "873fcdf659cd3f6ceb029b24767b54b141e385a93ec71104a082cf14ce539180", "ja": "約束？", "zh": "约定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0481d2305bca146197a543ed3f21820bc53daa4480aa05efc933ba449a5fc936", "ja": "も～、アイスですよ！　元気になったら、\nおごってくれるって言ったじゃないですか―！", "zh": "真是的～冰淇淋啦！\n你不是说等我康复以后，就要请我吃冰吗──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2ecb203ba27001f1944e0c9c6465011299ba3364566eb8e95a68e25825438e53", "ja": "そうだっけ……というか、今からか？", "zh": "有这回事吗……话说，你是现在要去吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aabf7e42536becc8eaa04e8262ced8bd92e157133dfe7298f828fdb7100ec209", "ja": "今からです！　{$P$}さん、\n着替えるから待っててくださいね♪", "zh": "就是现在！{$P$}先生，\n我去换衣服，你等我喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0064_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "680f5fb47e0136fee6bc590296aa3bf2d5f3fc3034b9492abeec6a3c24d73a58", "ja": "えへへ、{$P$}さんとデート♪\n楽しみだな♪　アイス、いっぱい食べましょうね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，和{$P$}先生约会♪\n好期待喔♪我们去吃一大堆冰淇淋吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
